# Only what the extension needs at run time goes into the package. vsce lets a negated
# pattern win over every ignore, so the entries are exact files, not dist/src/**: the
# source maps, the test suite, the copies of reader.js / html.js the node tests load, and
# the README's screenshots (the marketplace fetches them from GitHub) stay out.
**
!dist/src/extension.js
!dist/src/webview/graph.js
!media/icon.png
!media/kgai.svg
!bin/**
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
